      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Smoking J.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. XP ledger: level 2, power rating 4 → CR 1 as a operative. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Venomous Casualty</strong> — Disaster Inc. (situational)</p><p>Status: Active — recovering from spider venom</p><p>Smoking J was bitten during the Battle of the Spider Grove and suffered a severe venomous reaction that forced his withdrawal from the front line. His incapacitation at a critical moment reduced the party's fighting strength during the most dangerous phase of the battle. Waluigi hopes Smoking J has fully recovered, though the long-term effects of arachnid venom are unpredictable.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Bite</strong> — “He was fighting alongside the main group when one of the dog-sized spiders landed a bite.”</li><li><strong>Pack Tactics</strong> — “The toad squad got cut off partly because there weren't enough fighters to maintain a continuous line.”</li><li><strong>Mechanical Aptitude</strong> — “Remi had to hold her position with only her mechanical dog as backup.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/smoking_j</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/smoking_j</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
